From 152d69647271a1e710e0e1087cb11e70c71d800f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cgscli <cgscli@localhost>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:10:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] P11: hide omp's built-in collab (cgsconnect replaces
 it)

Reason: ADR 0025 uses cgsconnect for live sessions. The upstream command tables are static; remove their live-session entries without disabling session export sharing.
Upstream: none (CGS distribution policy).
Remove-when: upstream supports disabling its live-session commands and their discovery surfaces without a patch.
